WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Create a parent category and assign a whole domain using its checkbox

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Rename it in parent category management. The saved URLs stay the same

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Choose another parent and check the domain to move its assignment
